    "detailed_description": "...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> you can customize and freely expand/resize most furniture~<br></li><li> change both weather and time to affect the atmosphere of your diorama~<br></li><li> most furniture is interactable (and squishable...)~ <br></li><li> custom furniture (drag and drop sprites into the game...)~ <br></li><li> invite friends to help you decorate your diorama (this game is not guaranteed to actually ship with friends but i'm working on it.....)~<br></li><li> pop bubble wrap~<br></li><li> there are no beds.<br></li><li> other stuff...? (there are around 1000 decorative pieces or so; despite the obvious decor counter, i\u2019m not actually able to count this high yet so i\u2019m just guessing really\u2026.)<br></li><li> <i>seriously though, this is just yet another decorating game so all you do is place stuff meaning you should keep your expectations low; but i still hope that you ultimately end up liking diorama since I put a lot of work into it!!</i>~</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls... but what do they do?</h2><strong>WASD / arrow keys</strong> - move around your diorama<br><strong>left mouse button</strong> - place furniture anywhere you like<br><strong>right mouse button </strong> - customize most furniture by changing their colour<br><strong>middle mouse button </strong> - copy any selected furniture (surprisingly, this might be the most underused button in most games...)<br><strong>R</strong> - flip/mirror furniture (useful for non-symmetric furniture...)<br><strong>F</strong> - search for furniture by typing names or keywords<br><strong>E</strong> - hide the interface<br><br><br><br>\u02da \u0f18\u2661 \u22c6\uff61\u02da \u2740",
    "about_the_game": "...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> you can customize and freely expand/resize most furniture~<br></li><li> change both weather and time to affect the atmosphere of your diorama~<br></li><li> most furniture is interactable (and squishable...)~ <br></li><li> custom furniture (drag and drop sprites into the game...)~ <br></li><li> invite friends to help you decorate your diorama (this game is not guaranteed to actually ship with friends but i'm working on it.....)~<br></li><li> pop bubble wrap~<br></li><li> there are no beds.<br></li><li> other stuff...? (there are around 1000 decorative pieces or so; despite the obvious decor counter, i\u2019m not actually able to count this high yet so i\u2019m just guessing really\u2026.)<br></li><li> <i>seriously though, this is just yet another decorating game so all you do is place stuff meaning you should keep your expectations low; but i still hope that you ultimately end up liking diorama since I put a lot of work into it!!</i>~</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls... but what do they do?</h2><strong>WASD / arrow keys</strong> - move around your diorama<br><strong>left mouse button</strong> - place furniture anywhere you like<br><strong>right mouse button </strong> - customize most furniture by changing their colour<br><strong>middle mouse button </strong> - copy any selected furniture (surprisingly, this might be the most underused button in most games...)<br><strong>R</strong> - flip/mirror furniture (useful for non-symmetric furniture...)<br><strong>F</strong> - search for furniture by typing names or keywords<br><strong>E</strong> - hide the interface<br><br><br><br>\u02da \u0f18\u2661 \u22c6\uff61\u02da \u2740",
